# Course Studio

Read `skills/course-studio/SKILL.md` in full first. ALWAYS start with the intake questions (context: school content vs programme, level, sessions, language, assessment rules, deliverables, look).

Quick reference:
- Write `course_spec.json` (`references/course-spec.md`, example `examples/python_school_ar.json`) — full content, not just slides.
- `bash skills/premium-design-kit/scripts/run.sh skills/course-studio/scripts/validate_course.py course_spec.json` → fix every ERROR.
- Pilot: `bash skills/premium-design-kit/scripts/run.sh skills/course-studio/scripts/build_course.py course_spec.json out/Course --only S01` → show the user → then build all.
- LOOK at the course plan, one full session pack and the gradebook before delivering.
